_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119017","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-06-26T08:07:31Z"},{"id":4610645290,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABEtDdKg","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"cb0c678a20b52c03c4a25a1140b0951de35bf84f","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180032?u=68d23e7ee9cdf810da125e8510b72f845b9dccc8&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/Calinou","id":180032,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MDAzMg==","login":"Calinou","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/Calinou"},"body":"Tested locally, I found some issues:\n\n- + icons turn into X icons when hovered in the Manage Project Tags dialog, yet they add the tag to the project when clicked:\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/e62a4e47-509c-48c2-8720-26b7bca96806\n\n- When clicking a tag in the Manage Project Tags dialog, it's not removed from the project (you need click on the X button next to it instead):\n\n<img width=\"406\" height=\"107\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/14289986-0a9c-4072-9e74-8a56286009e3\" />\n\nSome more feedback:\n\n- There is a red highlight when hovering a X icon, which is inconsistent with other X icons in the editor (e.g. the ones next to scene tabs):\n\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/4aa2e37c-53e4-4d75-909d-d9cab807047a\n\nI would probably remove the red modulate on hover for consistency, and also because it's a bit on the distracting side.\n\n- The height of the + icon button is inconsistent with tags:\n\n- <img width=\"138\" height=\"44\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/31f60948-8283-450d-b94c-2a5038b3cdba\" />\n\nI think we should reduce tags' size to make them closer to the + button's size, rather than enlarge the + button.\n\n- Add Tag buttons take a lot of space compared to the + icon on projects with tags, which looks a bit distracting (and makes the button look like an actual tag):\n\n<img width=\"403\" height=\"120\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/f8f075bc-5082-4f70-a0a4-88e54763fe3a\" />\n\nConsidering tagging is a relatively secondary function, I don't think it should look so prominent in the project manager.","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119017#pullrequestreview-4610645290","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119017","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-01T15:42:29Z"},{"id":4644341104,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFNMFcA","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"fc9dc0f172e81334d0b08d2870588ad69b2f6960","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","id":2223172,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjIyMjMxNzI=","login":"KoBeWi","type":"User","owned_private_repos":0,"public_gists":0,"public_repos":0,"total_private_repos":0,"url":"https://api.github.com/users/KoBeWi"},"body":"","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/119017#pullrequestreview-4644341104","pull_request_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/pulls/119017","author_association":"MEMBER","submitted_at":"2026-07-07T10:56:12Z"},{"id":4648906620,"node_id":"PRR_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABFRivfA","state":"COMMENTED","commit_id":"d96101ab6925a184491a2f044c66df614bc8dac9","user":{"site_admin":false,"suspended":false,"updated_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/2223172?u=fc85633b469acb6e7baef4dba5171f19a2a4ff85&v=4","created_at":"0001-01-01T00:00:00Z","followers":0,"following":0,"html_url":"https://github.com/KoBeWi","i